  "description": "Hello, I'm 20 years old Jian. I have two people I can't forget. It's not a legend that we were idols in our school when they were in school, but legends Dakyeom and Seungho. Those two people did that to me one day, let's become STAR-☆ with them... \n\nHowever, the friend of destiny did not stand still, so in the end, my seniors and I were mixed up. The seniors who left like that go to places where I can't reach... I thought you were lean??? Why did the seniors come back??? Yeah!? What do you want me to do? Idol?! What to do?\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes four extras.*",
